{"id": "sllama0247", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The main pollinator of many crops is the honey bee. However, other insects like b um blebees, moths, and butterflies also play important roles in pollinating various plants and crops as well.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
